'''Kaguya of the Coast''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Gals of Summer Blue Ocean (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Blue Ocean]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]] and is the summer variant of [[Princess Kaguya (Uber Rare Cat)|Princess Kaguya]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]] gains [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] targeting and the [[Shield Piercing]] ability.

